## 第三方来源 / Third-party sources

Glimpse 的「音乐」模块（`src/music/`、`src/settings/tabs/music-ui.ts` 与相关样式、设置页）是在以下两个 **MIT** 项目的基础上
修改而来。它们的版权与许可声明已并入上方 Copyright 行，许可正文与本文件相同（同一份 MIT 文本）。

The Music module of Glimpse (`src/music/`, `src/settings/tabs/music-ui.ts` and the related styles and settings page) is
derived from the following two **MIT** projects. Their copyright and permission notices are included above; the license
text is the same MIT text as this file.

### 1. LyricFlux

- 仓库 / Repository: <https://github.com/fhb263/obsidian-lyricflux>
- 版权 / Copyright: Copyright (c) 2026 eatgrass, fhb263 — MIT License
- 说明：在 Obsidian 里提供笔记内嵌歌词播放器、逐字高亮、侧边栏歌单与状态栏控制，支持 MP3/M4A 标签编辑、
  在线多平台歌词获取与翻译、多平台歌曲下载与试听。Glimpse 音乐模块的侧边栏歌单/歌词面板、逐字卡拉OK、
  双语注释、在线歌词、多平台下载与试听、标签编辑等功能与交互以其实现为基础修改而来。
- Description: an Obsidian plugin that turns listening into an immersive experience — an in-note lyrics player with
  word-by-word highlighting, a sidebar playlist and status-bar controls, MP3/M4A tag editing, multi-platform online
  lyrics with translation, and multi-platform download/preview. Glimpse's sidebar playlist/lyrics panes, karaoke word
  highlighting, bilingual annotations, online lyrics, multi-platform download/preview and tag editing are modified
  from its implementation.

### 2. obsidian-lyric

- 仓库 / Repository: <https://github.com/eatgrass/obsidian-lyric>
- 版权 / Copyright: Copyright (c) 2023 eatgrass — MIT License
- 说明：为 Obsidian 音频播放器加入交互式歌词显示。Glimpse 音乐模块的音频播放与歌词显示
  （侧车 `.lrc` / 内嵌歌词解析、歌词按行高亮与滚动）以其实现为基础修改而来。
- Description: adds an interactive lyrics display to Obsidian's audio player. Glimpse's audio playback and lyrics
  display (sidecar `.lrc` / embedded-lyrics parsing, per-line highlighting and scrolling) are modified from its
  implementation.
